WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.600
The fleet is asleep: no GPU VM runs while nobody watches.

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:06.500
A viewer arrives. Eight GPU VMs restore from a snapshot: every tile is back 2.8 s after the wake began.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:24.000
Eight NVIDIA T4s, one VM each, drawing one image.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Restart all eight GPUs.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Each VM is torn down and restored from its snapshot, its GPU reset and reattached.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Every GPU back 3.5 s after the click, as the coordinator measured it.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.000
One VM opened: restart just this one.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:59.000
Back in 3.0 s: old VM stopped 0.4 s, snapshot restored 1.1 s, GPU reset and driver 0.7 s, renderer 0.3 s, first frame 0.5 s.
